    "text": "By Meredith Yeomans ,\n2 hours ago A 22-year-old man is fighting for his life, according to his family, after being stabbed over the weekend in the Bishop Arts District. Police say they're investigating what led to the attack and surveillance video shows part of what happened. Relatives identified the victim as Abraham “A.B.” Herrera. Read full article",
